WEBVTT

00:13:25.546 --> 00:13:31.149
I could feel the meat of my muscles
on the bones of my legs,

00:13:31.173 --> 00:13:34.339
and as I walked,
because of the stimulation,

00:13:34.363 --> 00:13:37.863
I was able to voluntarily move
my paralyzed legs.

00:13:37.887 --> 00:13:42.759
And as I did more,
the robot intelligently did less.

00:13:42.783 --> 00:13:46.188
My heart rate got a normal
running, training zone

00:13:46.212 --> 00:13:48.982
of 140 to 160 beats per minute,

00:13:49.006 --> 00:13:53.752
and my muscles, which had
almost entirely disappeared,

00:13:53.776 --> 00:13:55.176
started to come back.

00:13:55.514 --> 00:13:59.117
And during some standard testing
throughout the process,

00:13:59.141 --> 00:14:00.887
flat on my back,